name phfquotetext
category Package
revision 41869
shortdesc Quote verbatim text without white space formatting
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides an environment for displaying block text
longdesc with special characters, such as verbatim quotes from a referee
longdesc report which may contain pseudo-(La)TeX code. This behaves like
longdesc a verbatim environment, except that it displays its content as
longdesc normal paragraph content, ignoring any white space
longdesc preformatting.
runfiles size=1
